00:37:02.083 --> 00:37:03.959
- My question is simple,

00:37:03.959 --> 00:37:05.542
do you believe that there is

00:37:05.542 --> 00:37:07.250
such a thing as black privilege?

00:37:07.250 --> 00:37:08.834
Like do you
believe that you can find

00:37:08.834 --> 00:37:10.583
privilege in your blackness?

00:37:10.583 --> 00:37:13.583
- And can we use Blackness
as an all-encompassing?

00:37:13.583 --> 00:37:14.291
- Yeah.

00:37:14.291 --> 00:37:17.291
Can we see it as a
perceived shortcoming?

00:37:17.291 --> 00:37:18.542
'Cause that's what it is.

00:37:18.542 --> 00:37:19.708
- Yeah it's perceived
as a shortcoming.

00:37:19.708 --> 00:37:21.250
I mean I want people
even when they see this,

00:37:21.250 --> 00:37:22.625
